                "On the Nitridboat-Wray NW-HIL nitrider mockup, Boat BT-8 sits with bed RTD "
                "612 C under a 640 C nitridation floor while the wall pyrometer, painted by "
                "the pad lamp, claims 671 C. Binding the RTD first holds silicon powder; "
                "binding the wall first would walk 2.6 t/h across a cold boat.",